    "text": "Australia awning is a non-cassette system in which the structure is based on a supporting square bar. The construction of the awning allows for installation even on small mounting surface. With big awning widths an additional reinforcement of the roller tube is used to prevent its deformation and uneven rolling of the fabric. It is also possible to use telescopic supports in this system. The arms are equipped with Flyer's chains which guarantee their reliable and safe operation even with large awning dimensions. The construction of the awning is made of extruded aluminium which guarantees its high durability and longevity. Brackets made from pressure cast and extruded aluminium provide high durability with relatively low weight. Square construction beam provides relative freedom of bracket placement.",
